- Global header (persona, zone, period, status)
- Page routing to all screens
- State management for pipeline results

### [NEW] `ui/components/design_system.py`
- Full CSS design system (Inter font, navy/purple palette, spacing tokens)
- All reusable HTML component builders
- Badge, pill, card, table, progress bar helpers

### [NEW] `ui/components/kpi_cards.py`
