### [NEW] `ui/components/investigation.py`
- `render_what_changed()` — KPI movement with materiality explanation
- `render_why()` — driver decomposition bars + segmentation table
- `render_evidence_panel()` — grouped structured + unstructured evidence
- `render_how_praxis_concluded()` — collapsible 6-step analytical chain
